  "description": "Aro received a dildo as a useless birthday gift, only to be caught with it by her childhood friend, Kang Gunwoo. \"Hey. Have you ever used it?\" \"...What?\" \"Never mind. What would you know anyway...\" Her embarrassment was short-lived, quickly replaced by a sharp surge of stubborn pride. There were exactly two things Gunwoo often said that she hated: (1) \"Never mind. I shouldn't have bothered.\" (2) \"Stay out of this, kid.\" But today, he had practically combined (1) and (2). Her frustration at having her past experiences dismissed turned into bitter resentment. Acting all high and mighty just because he was born a month earlier. \"I do things with that too, you know!\" \"Then will you teach me? How you play with yourself.\" Blinded by the idea of 'teaching' Gunwoo something, Aro ended up digging her own grave.\n\n_Source: RIDI, translated_",
